! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''ki'i''

;__ki'i__ (BAI):  as a relation of Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of ckini.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of ckini and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is (related to)               relatively; as a relation of ... -- the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''ki'i'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ki'i''

;__se ki'i__ (BAI*):  related to Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of ckini.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of ckini and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is (same as 1st)              related to ... -- the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''se ki'i'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ki'i''

;__te ki'i__ (BAI*):  with relation Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of ckini.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of ckini and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is                            with relation ... -- the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords:

